    {
      "title": "Harish Rawat quits all party posts after ED recovers cash from PA's house",
      "link": "https://www.business-standard.com/politics/harish-rawat-quits-all-party-posts-after-ed-recovers-cash-from-pa-s-house-126091200244_1.html",
      "description": "Former Uttarakhand chief minister Harish Rawat on Saturday announced his decision to step down from all party posts after the Enforcement Directorate recovered cash and jewellery from his personal assistant's house.\nA dozen luxury wristwatches and Rs 32 lakh in cash were seized from the premises of Chandan Singh Jeena during the ED raids undertaken on Thursday.\nJeena is currently serving as a personal assistant (PA) to Rawat and had earlier served as officer on special duty (OSD) during the Congress leader's tenure as chief minister during 2014-17.",
